1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
 "This grace does not remove the pain and difficulty of affliction.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
 It is an enabling power that allows us, after all we can do,

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
 to receive divine strength beyond our own,

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
 and lay hold on eternal promises through Jesus Christ."

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
 As Kenzie binds herself to Heavenly Father and Jesus Christ

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
 in prayer, obedience, and covenant keeping,

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
 they help her endure what she cannot bear alone.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,380
 That same enabling grace is available to all who turn to Jesus Christ.

9
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:37,340
 As we wait upon the Lord and exercise faith in Him.

